        "id": 1288034
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-01-16T06:35:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why not do it immediately (maybeStopMonitoringSockets) ? Right now clients only disconnect on binderDied, meaning that NsdManager was destroyed in the app, which I think is only done on app death (when the Context cache is cleared). So it won\u0027t be used by this app anymore.",
      "revId": "39637d9251919c2c74727b20abe2315ce56da5bf",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "036b3795_71d67b43",
        "filename": "service-t/src/com/android/server/NsdService.java",
        "patchSetId": 8
      },
      "lineNbr": 297,
      "author": {
        "id": 1308473
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-01-17T02:38:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Because other clients may be still acive and need socket for them. So we can\u0027t stop monitoring socket immediately. maybeScheduleStopMonitoringSockets will check whether there is an active request.",
      "parentUuid": "3efcd8fa_b1369d3b",
      "revId": "39637d9251919c2c74727b20abe2315ce56da5bf",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "fd90fc49_053c690c",
        "filename": "service-t/src/com/android/server/NsdService.java",
        "patchSetId": 8
      },
      "lineNbr": 417,
      "author": {
        "id": 1288034
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-01-16T06:35:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Also check for serviceType \u003d\u003d null: the ServiceInfo is provided by the app, so they could crash the NsdService thread if enough validation is not done.\n\nAlso max length:",
      "revId": "39637d9251919c2c74727b20abe2315ce56da5bf",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
